# The semantic IR rows lever (#11570).
#
# Add one `<issue>-<slug>` line when the semantic IR row encoder or decoder
# changes what a stored row means, or when the partial-flow derivation changes
# (the port table, the kill rules, the fixpoint) so stored rows differ for
# unchanged source. It is folded into `semantic_ir_producer_epoch`, so every
# stored lowered-IR and partial-flow row of every language is withdrawn once.
# Git merges this file with merge=union, so two branches that each add a line
# keep both. Never edit or remove a line; compaction replaces a prefix with a
# checkpoint line and keeps the identity.
# See .agents/docs/cache-identity-levers.md.
#
# Replaced the numbered literal `SEMANTIC_IR_ROWS_VERSION = 32`.
